  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:march_stone_bricks",
      "title": "Building with the March",
      "text": [
        "March stone, cobble and planks make a full building set. Four March Stone in a square give **March Stone Bricks**; four bricks give **Polished March Stone**; two brick slabs stacked give **Chiseled March Stone Bricks**, carved with a drum and a teal eye.",
        "Every stone has **stairs** and **slabs**, and all but polished stone have **walls**. The Stonecutter turns plain March Stone into any of them with no waste."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:march_door",
      "title": "March wood",
      "text": [
        "March planks work like any other wood: stairs, slabs, a fence and a fence gate, a door with lit window slits, a trapdoor, a pressure plate and a button. The usual recipes apply, and they burn like other wood."
      ]
    }
  ]
